来た時は\nちまとまあやで深夜までダンスの練習をしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/05/3852099/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれた方が来て良かった‼︎って言ってもらえるようなダンスをしたいから、頑張ります꒰｡•`ｪ´•｡꒱۶\n見てね～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前風邪をひいた時に思ったんだけど、\nまあやは、お母さんのお味噌汁と玉子焼きが食べたくなるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆は風邪をひいた時に そうゆう事ってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（今回はさゆにゃんも少し調子がよくなかったからさゆにゃんと一緒に病院行ったんだ～\n本当の姉妹みたいだな～って思ったよ 笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/05/3852099/0042.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは東京に戻って明日からも頑張りまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/05/3852099/0042.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/05/3852099/0043.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/05/3852099/0044.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[ハリーポッターみたいでしょ？この小さい傷"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/05/3852099/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまが写真撮ろうとしたら電源切れちゃったの！！！そのくらいの力をひめた手の傷だよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/05/3852099/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"]\n皆が元気で笑顔でありますように\nBYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/05/3852099/0042.gif","alt":""}],"source":"